    <description><![CDATA[<p>Each Sunday, Pitchfork takes an in-depth look at a significant album from the past, and any record not in our archives is eligible. This week, we revisit a 2016 album from France that reinvented the decade’s electro-pop as an idyllic Mediterranean dream.</p>
